The method optimizes for both memory efficiency and processing speed, using a `MemoryStream` to read the input data and a `BinaryReader` to extract metadata. It also ensures scalability by handling a wide range of input sizes and structures, and minimizes integration complexity by returning a custom `ImageFileInfo` struct that conforms to expected formats and structures.

