The implementation also includes robust error handling to manage potential failures in network communication or data consistency issues, and strategies to mitigate potential desynchronization problems such as re-broadcasting attack sequences or applying local corrections when necessary. The function evaluates the trade-offs between immediate responsiveness and long-term stability, considering the impact of aggressive error correction on server load and client performance.']

